{"articleNo":"103648","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=103648&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"구미지역 통학버스 운행시간 조정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.03.13","hit":"4707","attachments":[{"name":"구미지역_통학버스.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=103648&attachNo=73369"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1. 2주간 통학버스 운영해 본 결과, 일부 노선의 조정이 필요하여 붙임과 같이 통학버스 운행노선 및 시간을 조정하여 알려드립니다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 특히, 학생들의 건의에 따라 등하교시 옥계지역 운행시간과 구미역 운행노선을 아래와 같이 추가로 조정하였으니 이용에 착오 없도록&nbsp;바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 시행기간 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014. 3.17.(월)부터 추후 운행시간 조정시 까지</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 단, 공휴일 및 휴무일은 운행하지 않음</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 조정사유 : 옥계지역 승차인원 증가 및 정차 장소 추가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 조정내용 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">옥계지역 2회 추가 운행 및 구미역방면 원평2동주민센터에 정차 추가</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 옥계 지역 추가 운행 내역</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; WIDTH: 49.35pt; BACKGROUND: #d6d6d6; HEIGHT: 18.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.98pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 193.01pt; BACKGROUND: #e3f4e3; HEIGHT: 18.48pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\" colspan=